Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:04.10,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,250)}GRADUATION DAY
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:08.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}It all started 11,000 km from home…
