Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:18.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}…all the way to Swansea, Wales.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.30,0:00:21.95,Gold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}24 July 2026
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.05,0:00:24.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}The day we had all been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.10,0:00:30.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Suited up. Swansea Arena awaits.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:34.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Gown on. Cap ready.
