Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.50,0:00:41.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}All those late nights…\Nfor this one moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:45.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}One last walk as a student.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.90,0:00:50.55,Gold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Class of 2026
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.70,0:00:56.30,Name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}“Azrahein Azran Mohd Azis”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.70,0:01:02.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}Mum, Dad… I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.20,0:01:07.00,Quote,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}“Graduates, please turn around\Nand join us in a round of applause…”
